# Coding standards

- Prefer simple, direct code; no speculative abstractions.
- TypeScript strict; validate external/LLM data at boundaries.
- UI: Libre Bodoni + Public Sans; tokens from design-system MASTER.md.
- No Inter/Roboto as designed fonts; no emoji icons; Lucide only.
- Light editorial UI; no glassmorphism/glow/cinematic dark.
- Server Components default; client only when needed for editor interactions.
- Follow `Cursor.md`: surgical changes, goal-driven verification.
